NOTICE - Ft8Sharp.Deep

What this library is
--------------------

Ft8Sharp.Deep is where Hamlet tries to hear better than the decoder it came
from. Ft8Sharp beside it is a faithful MIT port of ft8_lib and stays one: it is
the instrument every measurement in this phase is read against, and its value is
that it cannot drift. Every improvement lives here instead, so a regression is
always visible against something known-identical to upstream.

